{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Long Live the Emperor</i> is a strategy simulation game where you rule an ancient Chinese dynasty, govern the nation, expand your empire, and ensure your bloodline endures. As long as the emperor lives and the treasury is full, the dynasty will stand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlight Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI Chat</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version will introduce an AI chat feature, allowing players to break free from fixed NPC text-based dialogues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/dcab66500f674f65991e4d2341824b18.avif?t=1764733257\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Degree of Freedom, Define a Unique Character</strong> <br>You can personally shape the appearance of your own character.Whether male emperor or queen, customize your image at will. From the details of facial features to the matching of headdresses and costumes, fully showcase your creativity and aesthetic taste, allowing the character to blend into this grand journey of dynastic power struggles in a unique way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/dd3403754b182e493cef277690a57646.poster.avif?t=1764733257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/dd3403754b182e493cef277690a57646.webm?t=1764733257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/dd3403754b182e493cef277690a57646.mp4?t=1764733257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/318cc3ffc79470d6d7f1548a18aceb55.poster.avif?t=1764733257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/318cc3ffc79470d6d7f1548a18aceb55.webm?t=1764733257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/318cc3ffc79470d6d7f1548a18aceb55.mp4?t=1764733257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Generations Endure, Destinies Entwine \u2013 The Family Genealogy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind every NPC lies the glory and hidden sorrows of their clan. From prominent lineages with centuries of official heritage to rising upstarts from humble origins, their blood ties and grudges (feuds) weave an intricate web of relationships. Harness the Family Genealogy System and secret reports to piece together clues, deduce the truth, and uncover the clan\u2019s hidden secrets and legacies. These insights will add more bargaining chips and possibilities to your power struggles and strategic maneuvers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/3413ce4f18a6864b3b7ae097067a8c1b.poster.avif?t=1764733257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/3413ce4f18a6864b3b7ae097067a8c1b.webm?t=1764733257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/3413ce4f18a6864b3b7ae097067a8c1b.mp4?t=1764733257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exquisitely Painted, Soul-Stirring CG Events</strong> <br>The game features more than 200 exquisitely detailed CG events. Every scene is carefully designed, enabling you to enjoy visual satisfaction while engaging in strategic battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/a9166e7da42c1095841e8589fab9e869.poster.avif?t=1764733257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/a9166e7da42c1095841e8589fab9e869.webm?t=1764733257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/a9166e7da42c1095841e8589fab9e869.mp4?t=1764733257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Appoint Officials</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen the Nation Select and manage officials, reward loyalty,develop industries,and secure funds for war or suppressing noble clans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/686a67a9a5fc4e0cd734a4595d639b6c.poster.avif?t=1764733257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/686a67a9a5fc4e0cd734a4595d639b6c.webm?t=1764733257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/686a67a9a5fc4e0cd734a4595d639b6c.mp4?t=1764733257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support Scholars</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weaken Nobles Recruit scholars through imperial exams, arrange strategic marriages,and impeach corrupt ministers to restore imperial authority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/17f1b8bdf8fe02a06b2dddb203f5bc2a.poster.avif?t=1764733257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/17f1b8bdf8fe02a06b2dddb203f5bc2a.webm?t=1764733257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/17f1b8bdf8fe02a06b2dddb203f5bc2a.mp4?t=1764733257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select Consorts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue the Bloodline Marry talented consorts and raise heirs who inherit their parents\u2019traits. Protect them from assassination and help them gain a foothold in court.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/034590c98e6ad517f7b3f7672528422d.poster.avif?t=1764733257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/034590c98e6ad517f7b3f7672528422d.webm?t=1764733257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/034590c98e6ad517f7b3f7672528422d.mp4?t=1764733257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Territory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer Enemies Lead armies to battle foreign invaders, seize resources, and expand your empire\u2019s dominance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/00806a750e2afff9a236b8aec86dd39e.poster.avif?t=1764733257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/00806a750e2afff9a236b8aec86dd39e.webm?t=1764733257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/00806a750e2afff9a236b8aec86dd39e.mp4?t=1764733257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynastic Succession</strong>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eternal Legacy Prepare for succession by balancing noble factions, securing loyal ministers, and stabilizing diplomacy to ensure a lasting empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/207ffb5c6f6207dc1be0ffa5d541dbf0.poster.avif?t=1764733257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/207ffb5c6f6207dc1be0ffa5d541dbf0.webm?t=1764733257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/207ffb5c6f6207dc1be0ffa5d541dbf0.mp4?t=1764733257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634340?t=1764733257","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634340?t=1764733257","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/eacf096dc384981434fd72167ffa5